      ],
      "description": "Whether the canary log is queryable via {helix_process_name=\"...\"} — the exact label a real 'Pipeline Process Logs'-style dashboard filters on. This is the panel that actually catches the 2026-08-28 incident: it can read MISSING even while 'Canary — Logs (ingestion)' reads PRESENT, which is precisely what a Loki label-promotion regression looks like (ingestion fine, label gone)."
    },
