      "description": "Raw Loki result-stream / Tempo trace count behind the canary presence stats above, before being collapsed into a 0/1 — kept visible so the 'count > 0' presence cutoff can be reevaluated at a different threshold without a code change, while alerting thresholds are still being calibrated."
