          "expr": "helix_platform_check_result_count{signal_source!=\"canary\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{signal_source}} / {{signal_type}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ],
      "description": "Raw Loki result-stream / Tempo trace count per real service, before being collapsed into the presence state timeline above. Services are discovered automatically each tick from recent Loki/Tempo label and tag values — nothing to configure. A service only appears here once it's had traces or logs activity in the lookback window."
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0
        }
