      "title": "Trace/Log Mismatch Rate by Auto-Discovered Service",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (service_name, missing_side) (rate(helix_platform_check_mismatch_total[15m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service_name}} missing {{missing_side}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ],
      "description": "How often an auto-discovered real service showed traces without logs (or vice versa) — the asymmetric case that points at a pipeline bug rather than the instrument being legitimately offline (which silences both sides equally and never appears here). Use this history to calibrate a real alert threshold before wiring one up."
    }
